# Countdown Timer

A simple and responsive countdown timer built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features

- Start the countdown
- Pause the countdown
- Reset the timer
- Set a custom time in minutes
- Simple and user-friendly interface

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## How to Use

1. Enter the required number of minutes.
2. Click Set Time.
3. Click Start to begin the countdown.
4. Use Pause to stop temporarily.
5. Use Reset to restart the timer.

## Project Preview

This project is deployed using GitHub Pages.
